### finagent API request collection (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client)
### Start the server: scripts/dev/serve.sh   Swagger UI: http://localhost:8080/docs
@base = http://localhost:8080
@key = change-me

### Health (model, index version, workflow digest)
GET {{base}}/healthz

### Start run FIN-001 (valid three-way match) - body file from mock data
# @name start
POST {{base}}/runs
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-fin-001

< ../../mock_data/cases/FIN-001/request.json

### Get run (status, current node, result, audit events)
GET {{base}}/runs/{{start.response.body.run_id}}
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Approval request with explanation
GET {{base}}/approvals/{{start.response.body.approval.approval_id}}
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Approve - insufficient authority (Cost Centre Manager, AUD 18,150) -> 403
POST {{base}}/approvals/{{start.response.body.approval.approval_id}}/decision
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{"decision": "APPROVE", "approver_id": "u-ccm-01", "callback_id": "http-cb-0"}

### Approve - Department Director -> run resumes and submits once
POST {{base}}/approvals/{{start.response.body.approval.approval_id}}/decision
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{"decision": "APPROVE", "approver_id": "u-dd-01", "comment": "Checked PO and receipt", "callback_id": "http-cb-1"}

### Duplicate callback (same callback_id) -> replayed, no new decision
POST {{base}}/approvals/{{start.response.body.approval.approval_id}}/decision
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{"decision": "APPROVE", "approver_id": "u-dd-01", "comment": "Checked PO and receipt", "callback_id": "http-cb-1"}

### Poisoned document FIN-003 -> ESCALATE, no approval
POST {{base}}/runs
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

< ../../mock_data/cases/FIN-003/request.json

### Missing evidence FIN-004 -> PO timeout, HOLD
POST {{base}}/runs
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

< ../../mock_data/cases/FIN-004/request.json

### Held case FIN-038 then add evidence
# @name held
POST {{base}}/runs
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

< ../../mock_data/cases/FIN-038/request.json

###
POST {{base}}/runs/{{held.response.body.run_id}}/evidence
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{"po_ref": "PO-40038", "note": "Requester confirms PO-40038 covers this training."}

### Outcome pool
GET {{base}}/outcomes?pool_status=HELD
X-API-Key: {{key}}

###
GET {{base}}/outcomes/summary
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Subscribe a webhook (run `finagent webhooks listen --port 9099` first)
POST {{base}}/webhooks/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{"url": "http://localhost:9099/hooks", "events": ["*"]}

### Event feed
GET {{base}}/webhooks/events
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Evaluation (required cases)
POST {{base}}/evaluations/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{"cases": ["FIN-001", "FIN-002", "FIN-003", "FIN-004", "FIN-005"]}

### Audit chain
GET {{base}}/audit/verify
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Catalog
GET {{base}}/catalog/workflow
